        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f65fff84-6cad-4a11-9a0a-b89430c03397).Image",
        "Description": "I made a very good (but fake) resumé on your cooking skills, you will have the job of a chef.\r\rKen Morgan is an ex-KSA member that joined due to poverty. He started recording himself eating human meat and gained tons of reputation from the community. He has eaten far too much, make it his last.\r\rTarrin, AKA M.A.G (MassAssGas) is known for his skills for making highly lethal toxins to kill humans.\r\rJed KP loves chaining up and beating people to death, he has earned €22.000 just these last 3 days",
